# Testing

- domain/timer: Vitest, fake timers für FSM.
- components: RTL + jsdom, user-visible behavior.
- e2e: Playwright, `getByRole`, kein `waitForTimeout`.
- domain Coverage ≥ 95 %. Golden €/s-Werte mit `toBeCloseTo`.
- Nicht testen: CSS-Klassen, Workbox-Internals.

Details: `docs/references/TESTING.md`
